WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.314
The centre of the galaxy.

00:03.014 --> 00:10.994
Twenty-seven thousand light-years from home, a black hole of four million Suns that the whole Milky Way turns around.

00:11.444 --> 00:18.238
The disc, bar and arms drawn around you are a model built from measurements; the stars are the measured part.
